,{"date":"2018-04-13T10:40:59-07:00","id":1206520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Novagain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1200184-c20-starts-shipping-this-week?p=1206477#post1206477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay, I missed that. So, more fallout from my fuckup</div> </div> </div> </div>I backed for the Book via Backer Kit rather than Kickstarter and did end up getting the Book of Freeholds PDF so I'm not entirely sure how the backerkit system works<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Novagain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1200184-c20-starts-shipping-this-week?p=1205846#post1205846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Folks in the US, are the books arriving for you via USPS, UPS, or FedEx?</div> </div> </div> </div>I got mine via USPS but I'm not sure if it is the same for everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3239,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3239-jane_dargason","user":"Jane_Dargason","date":".  Adding Annotations to my post 04-13-2018, 01:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3239-jane_dargason","name":"Jane_Dargason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3239_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T16:34:16-07:00","id":1206721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Novagain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1200184-c20-starts-shipping-this-week?p=1206266#post1206266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I went back and checked my pledge.<br /> <br /> I...apparently accidentally pledged to a PDF only tier that was in between two Deluxe Edition tiers. So, $195 and no book to show for it.<br /> <br /> I don't suppose anyone would have a suggestion as to how I could beg/plead for OPP to let me pay the difference? I've got a complete set of WOD20 Deluxe books thus far and it's really upsetting to not be able to complete the set.<br /> <br /> (Yes, I know I should've read it more closely)</div> </div> </div> </div>I cannot stress this enough: in the Kickstarter's final days we often tell people to check and double-check their pledges, <i>please check your pledges</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatar